IMPORT prelude
IMPORT `aba-welfare`

-- Animals and Birds Act 1965, ss 30, 39, 41-48, 19-21, 40(12) and 69 -- worked cases.
--
-- Every assertion is a claim about the ENCODING on stated facts, not about the law. Nothing here has been checked
-- against a decided case or subsidiary legislation (none was retrieved).
--
-- Fixtures are generated from a table of which flags are set (scratchpad gen_animals-and-birds-act-1965.py). Expected results were written by
-- hand from the text.

